        "original_id": "9e9e484c-b997-520d-bafc-b6aef8ccbf38",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Pacar, Aly Michalka, Allyson\n- Roles: Cody Jackson, Damon Young, Jimmy Francis\n- Works: Flight 29 Down, Make It or Break It, American Dreams, Now You See It...\n- Companies: ABC Family, Disney Channel\n- Topics: acting, music, Romanian descent\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Pacar was born Johnny Edward Pacuraru on June 6, 1981.\n- Johnny Pacar is an American film and television actor and musician of partial Romanian descent.\n- Johnny Pacar is best known for playing Cody Jackson in the television series Flight 29 Down.\n- Johnny Pacar is best known for playing Damon Young on ABC Family's television series Make It or Break It.\n- Johnny Pacar also starred in the Disney Channel Original Movie Now You See It....\n- Johnny Pacar had a recurring role as Jimmy Francis in American Dreams.\n- Now You See It... is a 2005 Disney Channel Original Movie.\n- Now You See It... is told from Allyson's point of view in a style similar to a documentary, and Allyson is played by Aly Michalka.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
